  "text": "This look is built for a crisp, frosty day when you walk from your home straight into the office. The cozy yet tailored wool-cardigan gives you that neat layer for work while the wide-leg trousers add volume without making you feel heavy at all. A slim leather belt in a soft camel hue cinches your waist, defining your X-shape and giving structure to the silhouette even with such relaxed pants. Ginger suede ankle boots bring warmth underfoot and just the right height for those twenty-minute steps on salted city streets.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the cardigan slightly into your trousers at the front to keep your waistline defined while leaving the back free, so you can slip a light jacket over it if the wind picks up.",
    "Let the wide-leg trousers drape naturally without tucking them in, so the clean line from hip to ankle remains unbroken as you walk."
  ],
