    {
      "n": "#278·22",
      "text": "These wide-leg trousers are made from a soft knit fabric in a warm camel tone, with an elastic waistband for comfort and subtle zippers running down the outer seam for a touch of edge."
    },
    {
      "n": "#332·00",
      "text": "This black textured cardigan features a ribbed crew neck, gold-toned buttons that catch the light, and a cropped hem that reveals your waist—perfect for layering or wearing alone on chilly mornings."
    },
    {
      "n": "#529·41",
      "text": "A slender leather belt in a soft camel shade, fastened with an ornate silver rose buckle that adds a delicate feminine accent without overpowering the rest of the outfit."
    },
    {
      "n": "#262·05",
      "text": "Ginger suede ankle boots lined with plush shearling for warmth on frosty days; their rounded toe and chunky sole give stability and style while you walk through snow-salted streets."
    },
    {
      "n": "#188·03",
      "text": "A structured pearlescent beige handbag crafted from pebbled leather, featuring a sleek flap closure with a gold-tone clasp and a long chain strap that can be worn across the body or on the shoulder."
    }
